{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2020-01-15 10:30:00', 'title': 'PNC Reports Full Year 2019 Net Income Of $5.4 Bln', 'text': 'PNC REPORTS FULL YEAR 2019 NET INCOME OF $5.4 BILLION, $11.39 DILUTED EPS.Q4 REVENUE $4.6 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $4.48 BILLION.AVERAGE LOANS INCREASED $1.2 BILLION TO $238.9 BILLION IN Q4 COMPARED WITH Q3.NET CHARGE-OFFS WERE $209 MILLION FOR Q4 COMPARED WITH $155 MILLION FOR Q3.PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP- QTRLY NET INTEREST INCOME OF $2.5 BILLION DECREASED $16 MILLION, OR 1 PERCENT, Q-O-Q.PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES - BASEL III COMMON EQUITY TIER 1 CAPITAL RATIO WAS AN ESTIMATED 9.5 PERCENT AT DEC 31, 2019 AND 9.6 PERCENT AT SEPT 30, 2019.PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP- QTRLY PROVISION FOR CREDIT LOSSES OF $221 MILLION INCREASED $38 MILLION, OR 21 PERCENT, Q-O-Q.PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP- QTRLY NET INTEREST MARGIN DECREASED 6 BASIS POINTS TO 2.78 PERCENT, Q-O-Q.PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES - RECEIVED APPROVAL IN JAN 2020 FROM FEDERAL RESERVE TO REPURCHASE UP TO AN ADDITIONAL $1.0 BILLION IN COMMON SHARES THROUGH END OF Q2 2020.QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.97.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.93 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
