{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2020-01-15 10:30:00', 'title': 'UnitedHealth Group Reports Q4 Adjusted Earnings Per Share $3.90', 'text': 'UNITEDHEALTH GROUP REPORTS 2019 RESULTS.QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.68.Q4 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.90.Q4 ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.90.QTRLY REVENUE $60.9 BILLION VERSUS $58.4 BILLION.QTRLY OPTUM REVENUES $29.8 BILLION VERSUS $27.6 BILLION.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $3.78, REVENUE VIEW $61.04 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY OPTUM EARNINGS FROM OPERATIONS $3.0 BILLION VERSUS $2.7 BILLION.UNITEDHEALTH - AFFIRMED FY2020 EARNINGS OUTLOOK, INCLUDING NET EARNINGS OF $15.45 - $15.75 PER SHARE, ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS OF $16.25 - $16.55 PER SHARE.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $16.46 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.UNITEDHEALTH - FY2019 MEDICAL CARE RATIO OF 82.5% INCREASED FROM 81.6% IN 2018.'}
